      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > Cash Flows",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Cash Flows",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Net cash used in financing activities in 2026 and 2025 were impacted by the following factors:",
